# p5 mcp: a search that matches no tool while a server could not start
# (47154a8f): what the model is told of the server it could not look in.
# `bad` writes to stderr and exits 3 at start (p5-mcp-fail-profile.json).
# The stdio server is p5-mcp-stdio.ts, which the profile names by `@BUN@` and
# `@SCENARIOS@` (capture.sh writes both in), and xfx is given the same profile.
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json p5-mcp-fail-profile.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json p5-mcp-fail-profile.json
gateway p5-mcp-unavailable-turns.json
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=full-access
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
wait 13
type look for a weather forecast tool
key Enter
wait 20
snap turn
gwlog
